OL,3,GNEWSAMarket Place deal paves way for
OL,4,AAssembly Rooms to go
OL,5,
OL,6,FA deal to carry out the regeneration of
OL,7,FDerby's Market Place has been signed
OL,8,Fahead of a meeting to allow the
OL,9,Fdemolition of the Assembly Rooms.
OL,11,FPlans for a new look Market Place,
OL,12,Fincluding a new multi-use building
OL,13,Fbeing built in the Assembly Rooms'
OL,14,Fplace, were agreed in July.
OL,16,FBut the scheme cannot progress until a
OL,17,Fcondition requiring a "Development
OL,18,FAgreement" to be in place, allowing the
OL,19,Fexisting site to be levelled, is
OL,20,Fdischarged.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
