OL,3,GNEWSAMarket Place deal paves way for
OL,4,AAssembly Rooms to go
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of a planning meeting to discuss
OL,7,Fthis on Thursday 3 September, Derby
OL,8,FCity Council said it had signed a
OL,9,F"milestone" deal with ION Property
OL,10,FDevelopments Ltd for the work.
